  (text "Normal power: a 12 V plug pack (centre positive) on the barrel jack.  D is reverse-\npolarity protection; the T8019L toggle switches the 12 V.  +12V goes to the 2-pin\nLCD_12V header for the composite LCD monitor, and to the Recom R-78K5.0-2.0\nswitching regulator (2 A, 6.5-36 V in), which makes REG_5V.\nPWR_SRC selects the 5 V rail: pins 2-3 = regulator (normal), pins 1-2 = the\nUSB-serial module on serial channel A (bench use without the LCD; the toggle\nswitch then has no effect; USB cannot run the floppy drive).  F1 RXEF160\n(1.6 A hold) protects the 5 V rail.  Budget: logic about 0.35 A at 5 V, floppy\ndrive up to 1 A at spin-up; LCD about 0.2-0.3 A at 12 V.  Use a 12 V supply of\nat least 1.5 A.  T8019L and RXEF fuse footprints are in lib/MyParts.pretty;\ncheck the switch footprint against a real T8019L before ordering boards." (at 25.4 112.72 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 13c0c8f5-6fc0-4506-a089-d9b596107ebd)
  )
)
